OL,3,GFEATURESCThe introduction of colour on
OL,4,CBBC One and ITV
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis weekend marks the 56th anniversary
OL,7,Fof the start of colour television on
OL,8,FBBC One and ITV.
OL,10,FBoth main channels were allowed to
OL,11,Fbroadcast in UHF on 625 lines in colour
OL,12,Ffrom 15th November 1969.
OL,14,FThis date was dictated by the
OL,15,Fgovernment not the choice of the
OL,16,Fbroadcasters themselves ` something
OL,17,Fthat may seem unimaginable now.
OL,19,FBBC Two had been broadcasting in colour
OL,20,Ffor two years by then and was, of
OL,21,Fcourse, only on UHF and 625 lines from
OL,22,Fthe start.
OL,23,APub: 16-Nov-2025Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,126,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12502
