CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F125A1786056988
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G2/16
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESCThe introduction of colour on
OL,4,CBBC One and ITV
OL,5,
OL,6,FA recent post on a TV chatroom asked an
OL,7,Finteresting question: When did your BBC
OL,8,FOne region go colour?
OL,10,FThe answer is not simple but it's a
OL,11,Fstory worth telling.
OL,13,FIt is easy to say when each ITV company
OL,14,Fswitched to colour. These were big
OL,15,Fevents for the company locally and
OL,16,Foften accompanied by huge promotional
OL,17,Factivity.
OL,19,FThe big 5 ` Thames, LWT, ATV, Yorkshire
OL,20,Fand Granada ` all switched to colour in
OL,21,FNovember 1969.
OL,23,APub: 16-Nov-2025Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,126,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12503
SC,0003
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F125A1786056988
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G3/16
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESCThe introduction of colour on
OL,4,CBBC One and ITV
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt was not certain until a late stage
OL,7,Fthat the Emley Moore transmitter
OL,8,Fserving Yorkshire ` then a temporary
OL,9,Fstructure after the collapse of the
OL,10,Fmain mast a few months earlier ` would
OL,11,Fbe ready for the 15th.
OL,13,FTV Times had a special colour cover in
OL,14,FLondon, the Midlands and the North West
OL,15,Fbut not Yorkshire.
OL,17,FThe other ITV companies across Great
OL,18,FBritain and Northern Ireland gradually
OL,19,Fswitched to colour transmission over
OL,20,Fthe next two years with great local
OL,21,Ffanfare.
OL,23,APub: 16-Nov-2025Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,126,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12504
SC,0004
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F125A1786056988
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G4/16
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESCThe introduction of colour on
OL,4,CBBC One and ITV
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt should be remembered that the order
OL,7,Fhad nothing to do with the local
OL,8,Fcompanies ` it was about the extension
OL,9,Fof the UHF transmitter network by the
OL,10,FBBC and ITA.
OL,12,FBut, in general, the large and
OL,13,Fmedium-sized companies were also able
OL,14,Fto produce a large proportion of their
OL,15,Flocal output in colour at the point of
OL,16,Fswitchover.
OL,18,FSTV ` recovering from a fire which
OL,19,Fdevastated their main Glasgow studio `
OL,20,Fstill had a colour OB unit and a colour
OL,21,Fstudio in Edinburgh.
OL,23,APub: 16-Nov-2025Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,126,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12505
SC,0005
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F125A1786056988
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G5/16
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESCThe introduction of colour on
OL,4,CBBC One and ITV
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouthern moved to a new studio complex
OL,7,Fwhich was ready for colour.
OL,9,FBut some small companies like Border
OL,10,Fand Grampian had very limited colour
OL,11,Ffacilities to begin with.
OL,13,FMy understanding is that all Border's
OL,14,Fprogrammes remained in black and white.
OL,15,FBut it was able to show network
OL,16,Fprogrammes, programmes played out from
OL,17,Ffilm and adverts in colour from 1971.
OL,18,FBut it had no colour production or
OL,19,Fcolour VT facilities of its own to
OL,20,Fbegin with.
OL,23,APub: 16-Nov-2025Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,126,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12506
SC,0006
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F125A1786056988
