OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESCThe introduction of colour on
OL,4,CBBC One and ITV
OL,5,
OL,6,FGrampian may have been in a similar
OL,7,Fsituation.
OL,9,FGenerally, the launch of ITV in colour
OL,10,Fwas a big event in each region.
OL,12,FITA trade test transmissions continued
OL,13,Fto use the monochrome test card D until
OL,14,Fthe local switch to UHF and colour.
OL,16,FTV Times' regional editions did not
OL,17,Froutinely mention whether a programme
OL,18,Fwas in colour until colour was actually
OL,19,Favailable in that region.
OL,23,APub: 16-Nov-2025Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,126,120,200,300,0,100
