OL,3,GFEATURESCThe introduction of colour on
OL,4,CBBC One and ITV
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut, to go back to the original
OL,7,Fquestion, it was a different story with
OL,8,FBBC One.
OL,10,FBBC One network simply switched to
OL,11,Fcolour on 15th November 1969.
OL,13,FVHF viewers across the country were
OL,14,Fsimply watching a monochrome downscaled
OL,15,Fversion of the colour service.
OL,17,FThe mirror globe proudly boasted the
OL,18,Flegend "BBC 1 COLOUR". Announcers
OL,19,Fhighlighted when programmes remained in
OL,20,Fblack and white.
OL,23,APub: 16-Nov-2025Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,126,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12508
SC,0008
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F125A1786056988
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G8/16
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESCThe introduction of colour on
OL,4,CBBC One and ITV
OL,5,
OL,6,FAll editions of Radio Times highlighted
OL,7,FBBC One's colour programmes in listings
OL,8,F` in part, presumably, to avoid having
OL,9,Fto change pages routinely.
OL,11,FTest Card F was used for network trade
OL,12,Ftest transmissions on BBC One.
OL,14,FThe spread of the corporation's main
OL,15,Fservice in colour did lead to
OL,16,Fpromotional activity in the areas
OL,17,Fserved. But there was no promotion to
OL,18,Fsuggest that, say, BBC South or BBC
OL,19,FScotland itself was switching to colour
OL,20,Fstraight away.
OL,23,APub: 16-Nov-2025Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,126,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12509
SC,0009
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F125A1786056988
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G9/16
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESCThe introduction of colour on
OL,4,CBBC One and ITV
OL,5,
OL,6,FGenerally speaking, only the network
OL,7,Foutput was in colour to begin with.
OL,9,FPresumably though the regions had
OL,10,Fequipment to allow a smooth opt from
OL,11,Fnetwork colour to local monochrome ` it
OL,12,Fwould have looked horrendous had the
OL,13,Foutput suddenly switched to black and
OL,14,Fwhite when the region went into circuit
OL,15,F30 seconds or so earlier.
OL,17,FThe nations and regions gradually
OL,18,Fproduced more of their opt out and
OL,19,Fnetwork programmes in colour.
OL,23,APub: 16-Nov-2025Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,126,120,200,300,0,100
