OL,3,GFEATURESCThe introduction of colour on
OL,4,CBBC One and ITV
OL,5,
OL,6,GFOOTNOTES
OL,8,FThe vast majority of BBC One evening
OL,9,Fprogrammes were broadcast in colour
OL,10,Ffrom 15th November 1969.
OL,12,FThere were a few exceptions ` Z Cars
OL,13,Fremained in black and white for a few
OL,14,Fmore weeks although other drama was in
OL,15,Fcolour.
OL,17,FWithin a few months, it was very
OL,18,Funusual for a new network programme `
OL,19,Fother than a schools or adult education
OL,20,Fprogramme ` to be in black and white.
OL,22,FThere were conspicuous exceptions.
OL,23,APub: 16-Nov-2025Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,126,120,200,300,0,100
