OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESCThe introduction of colour on
OL,4,CBBC One and ITV
OL,5,
OL,6,FBlue Peter did not go into colour until
OL,7,FSeptember 1970.
OL,9,FThere is some ambiguity concerning when
OL,10,Fthe studio presentation of the network
OL,11,Fportion of Nationwide went into colour.
OL,12,FThe programme was not billed as a
OL,13,Fcolour programme and a lot of the
OL,14,Freports and interviews from the regions
OL,15,Fwere in black and white for many years.
OL,17,FWhile no colour recordings of
OL,18,FNationwide in this era are believed to
OL,19,Fexist, the BBC archive holds some film
OL,20,Freports from Nationwide in 1969/70
OL,21,Fwhich were in colour.
OL,23,APub: 16-Nov-2025Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,126,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12515
SC,0015
