OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                G15/16
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESCThe introduction of colour on
OL,4,CBBC One and ITV
OL,5,
OL,6,FGenerally when BBC One colour
OL,7,Ftransmissions spread to a new region,
OL,8,Fthe regional output initially stayed in
OL,9,Fmonochrome.
OL,11,FAnother Interesting point...
OL,13,FWhile there were restrictions on full
OL,14,Fcolour transmissions before 15th
OL,15,FNovember 1969, these did not apply to
OL,16,Fthe spread of colour afterwards.
OL,23,APub: 16-Nov-2025Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,126,120,200,300,0,100
