OL,3,GFEATURESCThe introduction of colour on
OL,4,CBBC One and ITV
OL,5,
OL,6,FPresumably each main transmitter opened
OL,7,Fafterwards would be putting out BBC One
OL,8,FUHF in full for a week or two before
OL,9,Fentering official programme service `
OL,10,Fobviously with the caveat that the
OL,11,Fservice was liable to interruption.
OL,13,FHowever I believe it was different on
OL,14,FITV initially ` more clearly
OL,15,Fengineering tests up to the official
OL,16,Flocal launch. Ad breaks were apparently
OL,17,Fcovered with the test card or bars.
OL,23,APub: 16-Nov-2025Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
